# ── Legacy /auth/ system retired 2026-08-26: this was a full parallel copy of
# an earlier site redesign (login, signup, gateway, password, welcome-*,
# offerings, terms) that stayed fully deployed and unblocked long after being
# superseded. offerings.html inside it used only a client-side localStorage
# check (`accessGranted === 'true'`) - trivially set from devtools - and its
# "Launch App" buttons pointed at apps that had no real gate at all
# (Sacred-Geometry-Musical-face.html, S-Geo-*, chromatic-wheel-of-sound.html).
# Two live gated apps (kcm-midi-chromatic-circle, rhythm-geometry-lab) linked
# a "Control Panel" button here; those now point at /my-apps instead.
